    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38005" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπᾰμοιβ-ᾰδίς</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαμείβω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>interchangeably</i>: hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὣς
				ἄρα πυκνοὶ ἀλλήλοισιν ἔφυν ἐ.</span> so thick they
			grew <i>with interwoven boughs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.481
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1030
			</span></i> (v.l.):—in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ᾰδόν. -ή,</span></b> 
			ἡ, <i>dovetailing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				35.43
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
